Z||000000||fieroluke||06-21-2001||12:20 PM||||Hi all,<P>okay, after trying to find a Getrag here in Germany, I've finally settled with an Isuzu 5spd. (I know it's supposed to be weaker, but  <BR>but I don't plan to abuse it, and if Archie thinks it's strong enough for his V8, it's certainly strong enough for me).<P>Anyhow. I'm using the V6 clutch with the Isuzu TO-bearing, shifter and cables. The car had a 4spd before, can I reuse the slave cylinder? The experts seem to be divided<BR>on the issue. Any other noteworthy experience  s anyone would like to share?<P>Thanks,<P>-Oliver<P>------------------<BR>Visit my website: <A HREF="http://www.fieros.de" TARGET=_blank>www.fieros.de</A>  for lots of technical and other Fiero related information<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fieros.de/jpg/mycars.jpg"> ||||reg||5
